flowchart TB
  F[Firmware: UEFI] --> B[systemd-boot or GRUB]
  B --> K[linux-rain / LTS / profile kernel]
  K --> S[systemd services]
  S --> D[Display manager]
  D --> DE[KDE Plasma or XFCE]
  DE --> W[Rain Welcome]
  DE --> C[Rain Control Center]
  DE --> L[Rain Learning Hub]
  C --> P[Profile manager]
  C --> U[Update preflight]
  C --> R[Recovery manager]
  P --> RP[Rain profiles]
  U --> PM[pacman transaction]
  PM --> AR[Arch repositories]
  PM --> RR[Signed Rain repositories]
  R --> SS[Btrfs snapshots or ext4 recovery]
  R --> RI[Rain Rescue ISO]
  RP --> CORE[Core]
  RP --> FLOW[Flow]
  RP --> FORGE[Forge]
  RP --> SHIELD[Shield]
  RP --> POCKET[Pocket]
